### Wide content

{% tabs %}
{% tab label="Wide table" %}
| Parameter | Type | Required | Default | Description |
|-----------|------|----------|---------|-------------|
| `filter[query]` | string | No | `*` | A search query that filters the results. Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. |
| `page[size]` | integer | No | `10` | The number of results to return on each page. Sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore. |
| `sort` | string | No | `-timestamp` | The sort order. Ut enim ad minim veniam, quis nostrud exercitation ullamco laboris nisi. |
{% /tab %}
{% tab label="Long code" %}
```shell
curl -X GET "https://api.datadoghq.com/api/v2/security_monitoring/signals?filter[query]=security:attack%20status:high&filter[from]=2019-01-02T09:42:36.320Z&page[limit]=25" -H "Accept: application/json" -H "DD-API-KEY: ${DD_API_KEY}" -H "DD-APPLICATION-KEY: ${DD_APP_KEY}"
```
{% /tab %}
